[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 1393.51, "timestamp": "00:23:13", "text": "好的。想結婚嗎？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1396.029, "timestamp": "00:23:16", "text": "你手指上的戒指"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1398.669, "timestamp": "00:23:18", "text": "。巫師。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1403.789, "timestamp": "00:23:23", "text": "喲，Q 讓你看起來大概只有 11 歲。什麼？耶。哦，是的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1405.75, "timestamp": "00:23:25", "text": "。好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1407.43, "timestamp": "00:23:27", "text": "哦，那裡有很多東西。是的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1409.59, "timestamp": "00:23:29", "text": "那邊那個冰箱裡還有很多東西。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1410.95, "timestamp": "00:23:30", "text": "裡面好像還有個小泰迪熊，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1412.51, "timestamp": "00:23:32", "text": "對吧？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1414.789, "timestamp": "00:23:34", "text": "好了，差不多就是這樣了。然後我們就可以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1420.23, "timestamp": "00:23:40", "text": "我覺得我們可以直接用"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1424.39, "timestamp": "00:23:44", "text": "手拿過來。不，還有一件。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1425.71, "timestamp": "00:23:45", "text": "哦，就剩最後一樣了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1427.99, "timestamp": "00:23:47", "text": "好了，你一定能行。我會慢慢地信任"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1430.789, "timestamp": "00:23:50", "text": "你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1439.59, "timestamp": "00:23:59", "text": "發生了什麼事？我的天啊，兄弟。兄弟，"}]